                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="obec_zink_rekneme_ne_moc__exni" Text="Let's say not exactly honest work." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_2" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="mlyn_mlynar_kr_prejdeme_d_2bO2" Text="Thievery? Hmph! Why call it the art of thievery? It's simply an art!" /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="obec_zink_to_mi_de_totiz__BdEH" Text="But that's what I'm best at, see?" /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_2" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="stea_mlynar_kr_drz_se_tam_8o6l" Text="Stick to where the light doesn't shine, dark clothing helps out as well. And only a complete idiot doesn't put away their torch while robbing!" /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_2" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="stea_mlynar_kr_zlodej_ma__Bgm9" Text="You have to be like a ghost that nobody knows about. And a ghost shouldn't get their hands dirty, or bloody for that matter." /></Response>
